OL,3,GNEWSARiver sewage leads to legal action
OL,4,Aagainst council
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows a formal complaint made to
OL,7,Fthe council in December 2025 by Eleanor
OL,8,FWarren, a rower, and Suzanne Cave, a
OL,9,Fresident of Taggs Island and a member
OL,10,Fof Taggs Island River Watch, about
OL,11,Fsewage discharges into the Thames.
OL,13,FRichmond Council has been contacted for
OL,14,Fa response.
